# vendor/ is NOT committed and NOT pre-generated.
#
# The parent flake's `flox-nri-plugin` derivation uses `buildGoModule` with a
# pinned `vendorHash`, which fetches Go modules in its own fixed-output
# derivation (network is allowed inside that FOD; the output narHash must
# match). If a vendor/ tree is present alongside go.mod, buildGoModule fails
# with "vendor folder exists, please set 'vendorHash = null;'".
#
# Keep this file empty of vendor/. If go.mod or go.sum changes, regenerate
# vendorHash:
#   nix build .#flox-nri-plugin 2>&1 | grep 'got:.*sha256-'
# and update flake.nix's `vendorHash` accordingly.
vendor/
